+Lenik's Changes to Tabler Icons
+================================
+
+Packaging layout:
+
+- \`orig/\` — upstream git clone (tabler/tabler-icons)
+- \`data/png/\` — generated PNG assets
+- \`bin/icons-tabler-icons\` — launcher for \`iconlib -l tabler-icons\`
+
+Contact: tabler-icons@bodz.net
